      "id": 470836,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-06-10T07:56:03.540Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sanmugam\">@Sanmugam</a></p>\n<p>You can achieve this by following these two steps;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Sales person contribution table has to be mandatory so that each time invoice must carry sales person details.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Role permission manager has to be set for sales person as following so that each one has to have access to his / her own created invoices only.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/6/f6db4497c8fd3ac320afc5e3686866a9b13aceb9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f6db4497c8fd3ac320afc5e3686866a9b13aceb9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6db4497c8fd3ac320afc5e3686866a9b13aceb9_2_690x426.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zdNeHw8PAuDZPgvE36Pqe5yq9L3\" width=\"690\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6db4497c8fd3ac320afc5e3686866a9b13aceb9_2_690x426.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6db4497c8fd3ac320afc5e3686866a9b13aceb9_2_1035x639.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6db4497c8fd3ac320afc5e3686866a9b13aceb9_2_1380x852.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1437×889 59.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
