      "created_at": "2025-06-10T08:44:21.532Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>If one sales person needs to be tagged with one sales invoice at a time, then you have to bring sales person link record upfront on header.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/b/9b785021585e2797501b2dfd560f89aa265582f7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9b785021585e2797501b2dfd560f89aa265582f7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b785021585e2797501b2dfd560f89aa265582f7_2_672x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mblMc8MB6wrFMQ5Ygt2BJUWwjCn\" width=\"672\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b785021585e2797501b2dfd560f89aa265582f7_2_672x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b785021585e2797501b2dfd560f89aa265582f7_2_1008x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/b/9b785021585e2797501b2dfd560f89aa265582f7.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1199×891 70.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Then apply user permissions for sales person as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/7/d7c926953dd5fc52368988e52bccd8c509b10705.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d7c926953dd5fc52368988e52bccd8c509b10705\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7c926953dd5fc52368988e52bccd8c509b10705_2_690x313.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uMVCpBL8xFdz1CwVuLSWsg88azz\" width=\"690\" height=\"313\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7c926953dd5fc52368988e52bccd8c509b10705_2_690x313.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7c926953dd5fc52368988e52bccd8c509b10705_2_1035x469.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7c926953dd5fc52368988e52bccd8c509b10705_2_1380x626.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1906×867 51 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
